=== demo (CLI defaults): mi_3bin and norm_pearson
  mi_3bin
    metric_validity=PASS | design_adequacy=CORRECTED[POWER_NOT_ASSESSED,ATTENUATION] | effect=INCONCLUSIVE | replication=NOT_RUN
    VERDICT: INCONCLUSIVE — effect -0.003202 [-0.0855, +0.07909], p=0.926 (exact permutation); no SESOI pre-registered, so equivalence cannot be tested; the raw difference +0.02553 (not detected at the replicate level, p=0.518) shrinks to -13% at equal depth
  norm_pearson
    metric_validity=PASS | design_adequacy=CORRECTED[POWER_NOT_ASSESSED,ATTENUATION] | effect=INCONCLUSIVE | replication=NOT_RUN
    VERDICT: INCONCLUSIVE — effect -0.03789 [-0.1318, +0.05598], p=0.403 (exact permutation); no SESOI pre-registered, so equivalence cannot be tested
